title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/duplicates:activate
catalog: GUI command
target: duplicates:activate
summary: Duplicates: unfold the group / show the copy (here / other / new)

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``duplicates`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``b enter`` → ``duplicates:activate new`` (in the ``duplicates`` panel)
* ``enter`` → ``duplicates:activate other`` (in the ``duplicates`` panel)
* ``i enter`` → ``duplicates:activate here`` (in the ``duplicates`` panel)
